  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Elections Environment Project (VEEP III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu&#x2019;s electoral and political environment faces several challenges including citizen-MP relationships based on familiarity rather than program performance, underrepresentation of women in political life, voter apathy, a volatile political party environment and a need to improve further the functioning and sustainability of the electoral authorities. The VEEP III project builds on previous electoral assistance to Vanuatu and its main objective is to further the democratic development of Vanuatu. The project will do this by further strengthening the Electoral Commission (EC) and the Vanuatu Electoral Office (VEO) to more effectively implement their mandate and ensure inclusive, transparent, and credible electoral processes and by improving the institutional environment and practice of democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
